config UART_VRETENO
	bool "Vreteno serial port"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_HDLFACTORY_VRETENO_UART_ENABLED
	select SERIAL_HAS_DRIVER
	help
	  The serial port of the Vreteno machine: one data register, one
	  status register and one receive register. Polled only, since
	  the hardware raises an interrupt for a byte received and none
	  for a byte sent, so there is nothing for an interrupt-driven
	  transmit path to wait on.

	  `SERIAL_HAS_DRIVER` is what `UART_CONSOLE` depends on. A
	  driver that does not select it builds, and the console then
	  silently is not a console: the symbol never becomes visible
	  and the board defconfig's request for it is dropped without a
	  word.
